<title>USA: Exten Industries settles suit with ex-CEO.</title>
<headline>Exten Industries settles suit with ex-CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exten Industries Inc said on Wednesday it had settled its lawsuit with former Chief Executive Officer Robert Goldsmith.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Sybiol is a device that performs a function for the liver much like the function dialysis performs for kidneys and is intended to be used during and after transplant surgery.</p>
</text>
